% SCAFFOLDING stand-in for SIMPOS's class `inferior_window`, compiled by
% psi/espc.py into the package `simpos`.  It is NOT SIMPOS: the class body
% is lost (docs/simpos/subsystems/window.md §0.3, §1.2).  MENDELS (IFS
% No.61), 2026-11-27: the base class of MENDELS's own `base`, `graphic`
% and `inferior_turn_menu` (win_class.esp) and of the composites its panes
% are made of.  `inferior_window` is the last nature in 110 of 132 held
% uses (window.md §1.2); WINCS calls it 階層ウィンドウ, a hierarchical
% window, and requires one of inferior_window, popup_window and
% temporary_window (WINCS p5, p7-8, PROSE).
%
% THE NATURE LIST IS INFERENCE: TM-125 p8 (4.2) has as_inferior "the
% function as a sub window.  All the window class which is defined by the
% user must inherit this class" and basic_window "Every window must
% inherit this class"; WINCS's inferior_window plays the role of TM-125's
% user_window (window.md §1.2).  as_inferior is not stood in: the body,
% sub-windows included, is basic_window.esp's.  It has no method of its
% own.

class inferior_window has

nature
        as_inferior,
        basic_window;

end.
